+	/*
+	 * 0277: sweetnoumount=1 keeps the root mounted at reboot (sync only). On the 6T the final unmount of / never returned
+	 * (logs 2026-11-12: the last line is "unmount(0) /", no "vfs_unmountall(system) end"), the SoC watchdog then bit and the
